        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ma ede edetaru Yehova Mungu miniri dri ti kani kabinyebileko be, kani afa onzi azini be yi ruaari aluni ku; a’disiku eri ovu afa Yehova Mungu minirini ngule onziri’i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
